I died once by trying to tin a cockatrice without gloves...it even said
so on my gravestone and in the high score file (sigh).  I've also died by
eating a cockatrice egg, eating a tin of cockatrice meat (you know how
tinning takes the poison out of kobolds, etc?  oh well...), biting a 
cockatrice, swallowing a cockatrice whole, feeling a cockatrice corpse
while blind, falling down the stairs while wielding one, bumping into one
while naked (chasing a nurse), and by accidentally reverse genociding them--
"You have found a scroll of genocide! What monster do you want to genocide?"
(I didn't know it was cursed :( )
   BTW, I thought it would be neat if there were a monster, say a cyclops,
that was as tough as a minotaur, but with a floating eye's gaze--something
to watch out for when you're "invincible" later in the game!
  I know, I know...it's really sick to make the game harder, but when you
have a character that can take off all his armor and still best all the
Wizards little toadies, it's time for some new monsters.


